<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>第三集：守護家人的智慧生活 - 家庭故事</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", "Noto Serif TC", serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff 0%, #0984e3 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff 0%, #0984e3 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header .episode-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        
        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            opacity: 0.95;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .story-content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        
        .scene {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
        
        .scene-image {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .scene-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .scene-image .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6e9 0%, #b2bec3 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #636e72;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }
        
        .scene-text {
            padding: 0 10px;
        }
        
        .scene-text p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        
        .scene-text .dialogue {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
            padding: 20px 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #0984e3;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        
        .scene-text .dialogue strong {
            color: #0984e3;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }
        
        .scene-text .dialogue .text {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }
        
        .part-divider {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff 0%, #0984e3 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px -30px;
        }
        
        .part-divider h2 {
            font-size: 1.8em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .part-divider p {
            opacity: 0.9;
            font-size: 1em;
        }
        
        .character-intro {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }
        
        .character-intro h3 {
            color: #0984e3;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .character-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .character {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        
        .character .emoji {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .character h4 {
            color: #0984e3;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }
        
        .character p {
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .tech-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6e9 0%, #b2bec3 100%);
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .tech-info h3 {
            color: #2d3436;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .tech-info .items {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .tech-info .item {
            background: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #636e72;
        }
        
        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        
        .footer a {
            color: #0984e3;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .back-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff 0%, #0984e3 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .back-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .scene-number {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0984e3;
            color: white;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            line-height: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }
            
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 1.6em;
            }
            
            .story-content {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
            
            .part-divider {
                margin: 30px -20px;
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
            
            .part-divider h2 {
                font-size: 1.4em;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="episode-tag">🎬 第三集</div>
            <h1>守護家人的智慧生活</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">爸爸研究智慧電源模組，讓家裡更安全、更智慧...</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="story-content">
            <!-- 技術資訊 -->
            <div class="tech-info">
                <h3>⚡ 本集技術重點</h3>
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="item">220V 電力</div>
                    <div class="item">智慧電源模組</div>
                    <div class="item">WiFi 控制</div>
                    <div class="item">冷氣 + 熱泵</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 角色介紹 -->
            <div class="character-intro">
                <h3>👨‍👩‍👦 故事角色</h3>
                <div class="character-grid">
                    <div class="character">
                        <div class="emoji">👨</div>
                        <h4>爸爸</h4>
                        <p>平時會想東想西<br>想把家裡弄得更好</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="character">
                        <div class="emoji">👩</div>
                        <h4>媽媽凱莉</h4>
                        <p>50 多歲<br>賢慧、操心</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="character">
                        <div class="emoji">👦</div>
                        <h4>哥哥阿布吉</h4>
                        <p>20 歲大學生<br>外冷內熱</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="character">
                        <div class="emoji">👦</div>
                        <h4>弟弟棉花糖</h4>
                        <p>15 歲高中生<br>活力充沛</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 第一部分 -->
            <div class="part-divider">
                <h2>第一部分：危機浮現</h2>
                <p>爸爸看到新聞，心裡開始擔心...</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景1: 客廳 - 爸爸看新聞</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">1</span>晚上吃完飯，爸爸坐在客廳看電視。新聞正在播放一則住宅火警的報導。</p>
                    <p>「又有一戶人家因為電線走火發生火灾...」主播嚴肅地說著。</p>
                    <p>爸爸皺起眉頭，心裡開始想著什麼。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景2: 爸爸的擔心</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">2</span>爸爸放下遙控器，眼神變得嚴肅起來。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text">「不對，我們家的電路也很老舊了...」</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>他想到家裡的冷氣和熱泵熱水器都是用同一條 220V 的電線，萬一同時運轉，負荷會不會太大？</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景3: 研究電力問題</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">3</span>爸爸開始上網查資料，研究老屋電路問題。</p>
                    <p>「一條電線分兩台機器...這很危險啊！」爸爸自言自語。</p>
                    <p>他發現如果冷氣和熱泵熱水器同時運轉，可能會造成電線過載，甚至起火。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 第二部分 -->
            <div class="part-divider">
                <h2>第二部分：尋找解決方案</h2>
                <p>爸爸開始研究如何讓家裡更安全...</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景4: 客廳討論</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">4</span>爸爸把家人叫到客廳，準備宣布他的發現。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text">「我發現我們家有個問題...」</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>媽媽和兩個兒子都看向爸爸，不知道他要說什麼。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景5: 爸爸解釋問題</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">5</span>爸爸拿出紙筆，開始畫圖解釋。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text">「你們看，我們家客廳的冷氣和熱泵熱水器是用同一條 220V 電線。如果同時開，電線會負荷過大，可能會跳電，甚至...起火。」</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>棉花糖睜大眼睛，阿布吉也皺起眉頭。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景6: 媽媽的反應</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">6</span>媽媽聽完，有點擔心。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>媽媽</strong>
                        <span class="text">「真的這麼危險？那我們該怎麼辦？」</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」我已經查到一個方法了！用智慧電源模組，讓它們輪替運作，就不會同時用電了！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景7: 棉花糖的好奇</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">7</span>棉花糖舉手發問。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>棉花糖</strong>
                        <span class="text">「智慧電源模組？那是什麼？很厲害嗎？」</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text">「很厲害！可以透過 WiFi 控制，還能設定排程，讓冷氣和熱泵輪流開，這樣就不會過載了！」</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景8: 阿布吉的興趣</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">8</span>阿布吉听到 WiFi 控制，耳朵豎了起來。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>阿布吉</strong>
                        <span class="text">「所以可以用手機控制？」</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」對！還能看到用電量，很方便！</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>阿布吉點點頭，难得表现出兴趣。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 第三部分 -->
            <div class="part-divider">
                <h2>第三部分：安裝施工</h2>
                <p>爸爸開始動手安裝智慧電源模組...</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景9: 工具準備</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">9</span>週末，爸爸把所有工具都拿出來，準備大顯身手。</p>
                    <p>螺絲起子、電工膠帶、智慧電源模組...擺滿了一桌子。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」今天要把我們家的電路升級！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景10: 爸爸施工中</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">10</span>爸爸戴上手套，認真地安裝智慧電源模組。</p>
                    <p>每一條電線都小心翼翼地接上，確保不會有任何鬆脫。</p>
                    <p>阿布吉在旁邊看著爸爸施工。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>阿布吉</strong>
                        <span class="text」爸，你小心一點。</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」放心，爸爸以前學過的！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景11: 棉花糖幫忙</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">11</span>棉花糖跑過來，遞給爸爸螺絲起子。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>棉花糖</strong>
                        <span class="text」爸，給你！這個對吧？</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」對！兒子長大了，可以幫忙了！</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>棉花糖開心地笑了。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景12: 媽媽送水</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">12</span>媽媽端著冰水走過來。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>媽媽</strong>
                        <span class="text」休息一下，先喝點水。</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>爸爸接過水杯，看著家人都在身旁，心裡感到溫暖。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景13: 完成安裝</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">13</span>經過一番努力，智慧電源模組終於安裝完成了！</p>
                    <p>爸爸站起來，滿意地看著自己的作品。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」好了！現在我們家的電路升級了！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 第四部分 -->
            <div class="part-divider">
                <h2>第四部分：成果展示</h2>
                <p>家人一起體驗智慧生活的便利...</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景14: 手機演示</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">14</span>爸爸拿出手機，開始演示智慧電源的功能。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」你們看！這是我們家的用電狀況！</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>手機螢幕上顯示著即時用電量和設備狀態。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景15: 棉花糖操作</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">15</span>棉花糖接過手機，興奮地滑動著。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>棉花糖</strong>
                        <span class="text」哇！好酷！可以開冷氣！可以開熱水器！</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>他隨手點了一下，冷氣馬上啟動了。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景16: 阿布吉測試</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">16</span>阿布吉也湊過去研究。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>阿布吉</strong>
                        <span class="text」爸，這個排程功能怎麼用？</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」可以設定時間啊！比如設定下午 5 點開熱水器，這樣我們回家就有熱水用了！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景17: 媽媽的感想</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">17</span>媽媽看著這一切，臉上露出欣慰的笑容。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>媽媽</strong>
                        <span class="text」你爸真的很厲害，想辦法保護我們全家。</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」哪裡，這樣我們用電也更省了！</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景18: 家庭會議</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">18</span>一家人坐在客廳，討論著智慧家庭的可能性。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>棉花糖</strong>
                        <span class="text」那我們下次可以加什麼？智慧燈光？智慧門鎖？</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」一步一步來，先把基礎打好再說！</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>阿布吉</strong>
                        <span class="text」我覺得可以加個智慧窗簾，早上自動打開。</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>全家人都笑了。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="scene">
                <div class="scene-image">
                    <div class="placeholder">📷 場景19: 結語</div>
                </div>
                <div class="scene-text">
                    <p><span class="scene-number">19</span>晚上，關上燈，爸爸用手機關掉冷氣。</p>
                    <p>看著螢幕上顯示「所有設備已關閉」，他安心地笑了。</p>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>爸爸</strong>
                        <span class="text」這樣就不用擔心睡覺的時候電器過載了。大家晚安！</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialogue">
                        <strong>媽媽</strong>
                        <span class="text」晚安！謝謝你保護我們的家。</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 結語 -->
            <div class="part-divider">
                <h2>🎉 完</h2>
                <p>謝謝觀看！</p>
            </div>
            
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <a href="../index.html" class="back-button">🏠 回首頁</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
